music BGM17A.mp3
text Among the students who are travelling to school, a single one stands out, stopped in her tracks.
text It's Tomoyo.
text She is gazing up fixedly at the sakura tree.
text I go up to her and try doing the same.
text Due to the rain, all of the cherry blossoms have fallen down. There aren't any pink petals left on the tree anymore.
text I look back to Tomoyo.
text As if she's forgotten all about the time, her eyes are fixed upon the sakura tree.
text @[Tomoya]
text (You're going to be late, you know...)
if intF[211] == 0
	goto s2
fi
goto 3
label s2
goto 5
label 3
choice Say something|Ignore her
setvar intF[1089] = selected
sound 02.aac
setvar intF[1089] - 1
if intF[1089] == 0
	goto s3
fi
goto 4
label s3
goto 6
label 4
if intF[1089] == 1
	goto s4
fi
goto 6
label s4
label 5
text Well... It doesn't matter to me if someone else is late to class.
text I climb up the hill alone.
if rtf1 != ""
	jump $rtf1 $rtl1
fi
jump $rtf0 $rtl0
label 6
text @[Tomoya]
text What're you standing around for? Don't you know you're going to be late?
text After calling out to her, I start wondering how strange what I am doing is.
text Just why am I talking to this kind of person?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGTM11"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGTM11.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
