text @[Tomoyo]
text I'm grateful that you called out to me.
sound 5Q2.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Thank you.
text She still genuinely thanks someone, even for something small like this. What an open-hearted girl.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text Well now, go on.
