text @[Tomoyo]
text Aren't you coming too?
text @[Tomoya]
text You go on ahead.
sound 5Q4.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Aren't you coming with me? You'll be late, you know.
text @[Tomoya]
text I don't mind.
sound 5Q5.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Why?
text @[Tomoya]
text Hm, well... I'm actually quite shy.
text @[Tomoya]
text So I just want to climb the hill by myself.
