text @[Boy]
text Huh? Okazaki, it's pretty unusual to see you here this early in the morning.
text @[Tomoya]
text Ah...
text Just around when morning homeroom is about to start, my eyes find themselves looking down at my palms.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Come to think of it, I just walked to school while holding hands with a girl...)
text But...
